<Legal
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund policy for Hosted openagent.email one-time purchases."
>
  <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: August 24, 2026</p>
  <p class="lede">Hosted openagent.email is a one-time purchase.</p>
  <p>
    Because a hosted instance is provisioned specifically for your order, payments are generally
    non-refundable once provisioning has started.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you were charged in error, experienced a duplicate charge, or cannot use the service because
    of a fault on our side, contact us within 14 days of purchase. We will review the request and,
    where appropriate, issue a refund to the original payment method.
  </p>
  <p>
    This policy does not limit any non-waivable consumer rights that apply where you live. To request
    help, include your checkout ID and the email used at purchase.
  </p>
  <p>
    Payment availability: Alipay is currently the available payment method. We do not currently offer
    credit-card or Apple Pay checkout.
  </p>
</Legal>
